# Stackup rules (node)

Generated from stack detection. Keep project conventions here; shared editor
settings live in `.vscode/*`.

## Detected stacks

| Ecosystem | Confidence | Signals | Version | Package manager |
|-----------|------------|---------|---------|-----------------|
| node | high | package.json, package-lock.json | >=20 | npm |

## VS Code relationship

Cursor applies shared `.vscode/*` settings on import only; there is no live
sync. Edit Cursor-native rules here and shared editor settings in `.vscode/*`.
